ith the y-axis labeled for temperature in degrees Celsius ranging from 40 to 130 °C and the x-axis labeled for time in minutes.','diagram_page_98_diag_14.png','output_diagrams_sem1/diagram_page_98_diag_14.png','525x359','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific graph that visually represents data relevant to the topic of water evaporation.','2026-11-23 07:04:12',NULL),(276,1,'الوحدة 2: المادة والطاقة','الفصل 4: الطاقة وتحولاتها','الدرس 2: تحولات الطاقة','The diagram illustrates a turbine and generator setup, showing the turbine\'s operation with arrows indicating the flow of energy and the connection to the generator, which converts mechanical energy into electrical energy.','diagram_page_113_diag_15.png','output_diagrams_sem1/diagram_page_113_diag_15.png','1360x680','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific diagram that explains the mechanism of energy transformation in a turbine and generator system.','2026-11-23 07:04:12',NULL),(277,1,'الوحدة 2: المادة والطاقة','الفصل 4: الطاقة وتحولاتها','الدرس 2: تحولات الطاقة','The diagram illustrates the transformation of chemical energy from natural gas into kinetic energy, depicting a power generation process. It includes components such as natural gas, a turbine, and a generator, with arrows indicating the flow of energy.','diagram_page_114_diag_16.png','output_diagrams_sem1/diagram_page_114_diag_16.png','951x672','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific diagram relevant to energy transformation processes, suitable for educational purposes.','2026-11-23 07:04:12',NULL),(278,1,'الوحدة 2: المادة والطاقة','الفصل 4: الطاقة وتحولاتها','الدرس 2: تحولات الطاقة','A 3D pie chart displaying various percentages with the largest slice in dark red representing 38%, followed by a light purple slice at 23%, and additional slices in green, yellow, and orange representing smaller percentages.','diagram_page_115_diag_17.png','output_diagrams_sem1/diagram_page_115_diag_17.png','723x705','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific 