xis ranges from 0 to 5 kilometers. A red line connects data points plotted on the graph.','diagram_page_138_diag_30.png','output_diagrams_sem3/diagram_page_138_diag_30.png','472x503','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific graph that illustrates a relationship between two variables, suitable for educational purposes.','2026-11-23 07:26:52',NULL),(363,3,'الوحدة العامة','الفصل العام','الدرس العام','A bar chart titled \'كمية الألومنيوم المجموعة خلال الأسبوع\' (Quantity of Aluminum Collected during the Week) showing the mass of aluminum collected in kilograms on three collection days: الجمعة (Friday), الأربعاء (Wednesday), and الاثنين (Monday). The y-axis represents mass in kilograms, ranging from 1.0 to 4.0, while the x-axis lists the collection days.','diagram_page_139_diag_31.png','output_diagrams_sem3/diagram_page_139_diag_31.png','497x497','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific bar chart that visually represents data relevant to an 8th-grade science curriculum.','2026-11-23 07:26:52',NULL),(364,3,'الوحدة العامة','الفصل العام','الدرس العام','A pie chart illustrating the composition of gases in the Earth\'s atmosphere, showing nitrogen (78% in orange), oxygen (21% in yellow), and other gases (1% in blue).','diagram_page_139_diag_32.png','output_diagrams_sem3/diagram_page_139_diag_32.png','401x417','YES','YES','The image contains a scientific pie chart with labeled sections representing gas composition, suitable for educational purposes.','2026-11-23 07:26:52',NULL);
