t; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }\n            .box-reasoning { background: #fffbeb !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <header class=\"lesson-banner\">\n        <div class=\"lesson-header-text\">\n            <h1 class=\"lesson-main-title\">📖 الدرس: الدرس العام</h1>\n            <div class=\"lesson-sub\">Grade 8 - Semester 2 Science &bull; 4 Scientific Diagram(s)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-actions no-print\">\n            <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"btn-action\">📂 All Lessons</a>\n            <button class=\"btn-action\" onclick=\"window.print()\">🖨️ Print / Save as PDF</button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"worksheet-cards\">\n        \n        <!-- Diagram #1 Card -->\n        <div class=\"diagram-eval-card\">\n            <div class=\"card-grid\">\n                <!-- Left: Diagram Image Box (Separate & Distinct) -->\n                <div class=\"image-box\">\n                    <img src=\"../output_diagrams_sem2/diagram_page_146_diag_40.png\" alt=\"diagram_page_146_diag_40.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <div class=\"image-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Diagram #1</strong> &bull; diagram_page_146_diag_40.png</span>\n                        <span>490x479</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: Dedicated 3 Questions for THIS Diagram -->\n                <div class=\"questions-stack\">\n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-short\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">📝 Question 1: Short Question (سؤال قصير)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">What is Ahmed\'s height at the age of 6 years?</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Answer:</strong> Approximately 110 cm.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-mcq\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">🔘 Question 2: Multiple Choice (اختيار من متعدد)</span>\n                <span class=\"diagram-tag\">🔍 Diagram-Based</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">At what age does Ahmed reach a height of approximately 150 cm?</div>\n            <div class=\"mcq-options-grid\">\n                <div class=\"mcq-option correct\"><strong>(A)</strong> 12 years ✓</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(B)</strong> 9 years</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(C)</strong> 15 years</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(D)</strong> 18 years</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Correct Option:</strong> (A) &bull; The graph shows that Ahmed\'s height reaches approximately 150 cm at the age of 12 years.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-reasoning\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">💡 Question 3: Scientific Reasoning (سؤال تعليلي)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">Explain how Ahmed\'s height changes from age 0 to age 18.</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Explanation:</strong> Ahmed\'s height generally increases with age, starting at approximately 50 cm at age 0 and reaching about 175 cm by age 18. The growth is relatively steady from ages 0 to 12, after which the rate of increase slows down slightly, indicating a typical growth pattern during childhood and adolescence.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Diagram #2 Card -->\n        <div class=\"diagram-eval-card\">\n            <div class=\"card-grid\">\n                <!-- Left: Diagram Image Box (Separate & Distinct) -->\n                <div class=\"image-box\">\n                    <img src=\"../output_diagrams_sem2/diagram_page_151_diag_41.png\" alt=\"diagram_page_151_diag_41.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <div class=\"image-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Diagram #2</strong> &bull; diagram_page_151_diag_41.png</span>\n                        <span>568x612</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: Dedicated 3 Questions for THIS Diagram -->\n                <div class=\"questions-stack\">\n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-short\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">📝 Question 1: Short Question (سؤال قصير)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">What are the two types of particles found in the nucleus of an atom?</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Answer:</strong> Protons and neutrons.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-mcq\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">🔘 Question 2: Multiple Choice (اختيار من متعدد)</span>\n                <span class=\"diagram-tag\">🔍 Diagram-Based</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">How many electrons are shown in the diagram orbiting the nucleus?</div>\n            <div class=\"mcq-options-grid\">\n                <div class=\"mcq-option correct\"><strong>(A)</strong> 5 ✓</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(B)</strong> 7</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(C)</strong> 12</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(D)</strong> 10</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Correct Option:</strong> (A) &bull; The diagram shows 5 red dots representing electrons orbiting the nucleus.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-reasoning\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">💡 Question 3: Scientific Reasoning (سؤال تعليلي)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">Explain the role of protons and neutrons in the nucleus of an atom.</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Explanation:</strong> Protons are positively charged particles that determine the atomic number and identity of an element, while neutrons are neutral particles that contribute to the mass of the atom and help stabilize the nucleus by offsetting the repulsive forces between protons.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Diagram #3 Card -->\n        <div class=\"diagram-eval-card\">\n            <div class=\"card-grid\">\n                <!-- Left: Diagram Image Box (Separate & Distinct) -->\n                <div class=\"image-box\">\n                    <img src=\"../output_diagrams_sem2/diagram_page_151_diag_42.png\" alt=\"diagram_page_151_diag_42.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <div class=\"image-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Diagram #3</strong> &bull; diagram_page_151_diag_42.png</span>\n                        <span>652x519</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: Dedicated 3 Questions for THIS Diagram -->\n                <div class=\"questions-stack\">\n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-short\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">📝 Question 1: Short Question (سؤال قصير)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">What are the two types of particles found in the nucleus of an atom?</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Answer:</strong> Protons and neutrons.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-mcq\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">🔘 Question 2: Multiple Choice (اختيار من متعدد)</span>\n                <span class=\"diagram-tag\">🔍 Diagram-Based</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">How many electrons are shown in the diagram orbiting the nucleus?</div>\n            <div class=\"mcq-options-grid\">\n                <div class=\"mcq-option correct\"><strong>(A)</strong> 5 ✓</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(B)</strong> 7</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(C)</strong> 12</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(D)</strong> 10</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Correct Option:</strong> (A) &bull; The diagram clearly shows 5 red dots representing electrons orbiting the nucleus.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-reasoning\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">💡 Question 3: Scientific Reasoning (سؤال تعليلي)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">Explain the role of protons and neutrons in the nucleus of an atom.</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Explanation:</strong> Protons are positively charged particles that determine the atomic number and identity of an element, while neutrons are neutral particles that contribute to the mass of the atom and help stabilize the nucleus by offsetting the repulsive forces between protons.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Diagram #4 Card -->\n        <div class=\"diagram-eval-card\">\n            <div class=\"card-grid\">\n                <!-- Left: Diagram Image Box (Separate & Distinct) -->\n                <div class=\"image-box\">\n                    <img src=\"../output_diagrams_sem2/diagram_page_153_diag_43.png\" alt=\"diagram_page_153_diag_43.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    <div class=\"image-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Diagram #4</strong> &bull; diagram_page_153_diag_43.png</span>\n                        <span>621x304</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: Dedicated 3 Questions for THIS Diagram -->\n                <div class=\"questions-stack\">\n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-short\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">📝 Question 1: Short Question (سؤال قصير)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">What are the two forms of carbon illustrated in the Venn diagram?</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Answer:</strong> Diamond (ألماس) and graphite (الجرافيت).\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-mcq\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">🔘 Question 2: Multiple Choice (اختيار من متعدد)</span>\n                <span class=\"diagram-tag\">🔍 Diagram-Based</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">How are the atoms arranged in diamond according to the diagram?</div>\n            <div class=\"mcq-options-grid\">\n                <div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(A)</strong> In layers</div><div class=\"mcq-option correct\"><strong>(B)</strong> In cubic crystals ✓</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(C)</strong> In a random pattern</div><div class=\"mcq-option\"><strong>(D)</strong> In a hexagonal structure</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Correct Option:</strong> (B) &bull; The diagram states that in diamond, atoms are arranged in the form of cubic crystals.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                    \n        <div class=\"q-box box-reasoning\">\n            <div class=\"q-box-header\">\n                <span class=\"q-type-badge\">💡 Question 3: Scientific Reasoning (سؤال تعليلي)</span>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"q-prompt\">Explain the significance of the intersection in the Venn diagram.</div>\n            <div class=\"answer-block\">\n                <strong>Explanation:</strong> The intersection of the Venn diagram indicates that both diamond and graphite are forms of carbon, highlighting their commonality despite their different atomic arrangements. This shows that different structures of the same element can lead to distinct physical properties.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n','2026-11-17 13:30:56'),(17,3,'الوحدة 5: النباتات وموارد البيئة','الفصل 9: النباتات','الدرس 2: النباتات البذرية',1,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>الدرس 2: النباتات البذرية - Science Worksheet</title>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Arabic:wght@600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --primary: #1e3a8a;\n            --primary-light: #eff6ff;\n            --accent: #2563eb;\n            --border: #e2e8f0;\n            --text-main: #0f172a;\n            --text-muted: #64748b;\n            --bg-page: #f8fafc;\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\n            --q-short-bg: #f0fdf4;\n            --q-short-border: #86efac;\n            --q-mcq-bg: #eff6ff;\n            --q-mcq-b